text I look through the open door, but I don't see Kotomi anywhere.
text I walk up to a group of three girls standing at the back of the classroom.
text @[Tomoya]
text I want to talk to Ichinose.
text A girl with glasses who looks like the leader of this group peers at me suspiciously.
text She looks around the classroom and says...
sound DUU.aac
text @[Girl 1]
text I... don't think she's here today.
sound DUV.aac
text @[Girl 2]
text Maybe she's absent. She wasn't here yesterday either.
sound DUW.aac
text @[Girl 1]
text They say that girl's never marked absent.
sound DUX.aac
text @[Girl 2]
text Yeah, I heard it's been like that since elementary school.
sound DUY.aac
text @[Girl 1]
text But that girl doesn't ever attend class, so it doesn't mean anything.
sound DUZ.aac
text @[Girl 3]
text Did you hear? She had a seizure on the way to school yesterday. That's why she left early.
sound DV0.aac
text @[Girl 2]
text What? A seizure?
sound DV1.aac
text @[Girl 3]
text I don't know the details, but it was horrible. She just started crying and screaming.
sound DV2.aac
text @[Girl 2]
text Wow... sounds like something's up with her...
sound DV3.aac
text @[Girl 1]
text That girl's too smart. Hearing about her having weird seizures makes a lot of sense.
