text Hey, wait...
sound DV5.aac
text @[Girl 3]
text What's his problem?
text I hear dissatisfied grumblings from behind.
text I don't say a word as I head back to my own classroom.
text I can't stand hearing them call Kotomi "that girl" anymore.
