text I'm lost in thought for most of the morning.
text I'm still thinking about yesterday.
text I go over my memories delicately, as if touching burn scars.
text In between her sobs, Kotomi was repeating something.
text She was trying really hard to move, as if running away from something only she could see.
text She looked like... a little girl to me.
text Kotomi was subconsciously remembering something.
text What could it have been...?
text I just don't know.
text @[Tomoya]
text (There's no way I could know, anyway...)
text I shake my head.
