text The teachers are just starting their lunch break in the office.
text I bow before entering and see the guidance counselor glaring at me.
text However, I have business with the Class A teacher at the moment.
text I wait at her desk for her to return from class.
text @[Tomoya]
text Excuse me.
if intF[411] == 1
	goto s12
fi
goto 13
label s12
sound DV6.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Um, yes?
text She looks surprised to see me talking to her.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is Ichinose absent today?
sound DV7.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Yes. I received a call saying that she will be out of school for some time.
text @[Tomoya]
text How long is "some time"?
sound DV8.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Um, aren't you Okazaki-kun from Class D?
sound DV9.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Do you have business with Ichinose-san?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
text I say it bluntly.
goto 14
label 13
if intF[411] == 0
	goto s13
fi
goto 14
label s13
sound DVA.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Oh. What is it, Okazaki-kun?
text @[Tomoya]
text Is Ichinose absent today?
sound DVB.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Yes. I received a call saying that she will be out of school for some time.
text @[Tomoya]
text How long is "some time"?
sound DVC.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I'm not sure. Considering what happened yesterday...
text The word "yesterday" rings strangely in my ears.
text She means that it's not something strangers should stick their noses into.
text But I don't want to consider myself a stranger to Kotomi anymore.
label 14
text @[Tomoya]
text Please tell me Ichinose's address.
sound DVD.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You mean her home address?
text I stare straight back at the teacher who is bewilderedly looking at me.
text I know that no explanation would be good enough for her.
text After this short staring contest, she gives a resigned laugh.
text She puts the textbook and attendance sheet she's carrying on the desk.
sound DVE.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Hold on...
text She sits down and takes out a different register of names.
sound DVF.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You just need to know her address?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
text She tears off a piece of paper and copies the address onto it.
sound DVG.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Will you be paying her a visit?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound DVH.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I think you should leave her alone for a while.
sound DVI.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Besides, the Ichinose house is...
text She starts to say something, but quickly stops herself.
sound DVJ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Did Ichinose-san tell you anything about it?
text @[Tomoya]
text No...
sound DVK.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I see. Then it isn't my place to tell you.
sound DVL.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It's fine to visit her, but don't put any undue pressure on her. Understand?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound DVM.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Good.
text I slide the piece of paper into my pocket.
sound DVN.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I was really glad to see Ichinose-san being more cheerful lately, you know.
text I make a quick bow and move to leave. But in the next moment...
sound DVO.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Okazaki-kun, can I ask you one thing?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes?
sound DVP.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Are you dating Ichinose-san?
text It's the same type of question the gentleman from the other day asked. What a tough question to answer.
if intF[411] == 0
	goto s14
fi
goto 16
label s14
choice Why ask something like that|We're not really dating
setvar intF[1089] = selected
sound 02.aac
setvar intF[1089] - 1
if intF[1089] == 0
	goto s15
fi
goto 15
label s15
text @[Tomoya]
text Why do you ask?
text I answer her question with a question, avoiding the issue.
sound DVQ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You're aware that Ichinose-san receives a special treatment of sorts, right?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
text As long as her test scores are good, she doesn't need to attend her classes.
text In the beginning, I envied this freedom that was given to Kotomi.
text @[Tomoya]
text But I think it's strange.
text @[Tomoya]
text She must have wanted to be with the other students.
sound DVR.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Yes...
text She nods deeply and then waves for me to come closer.
text What she's about to say must be a secret.
sound DVS.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I'll explain what I can for now.
sound DVT.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Some years back, there was a period when Ichinose-san's family appeared in the papers and on TV.
sound DVU.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Ichinose-san received a lot of attention at the time and was bullied because of it.
sound DVV.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That's why all of the adults who know about Ichinose-san feel the same way...
sound DVW.aac
text @[Teacher]
text "Let's leave her alone as much as possible."
sound DVX.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Because of that, Ichinose-san became used to being by herself.
sound DVY.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It may be our fault that she turned out the way she did.
sound DVZ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That's why we needed someone to change Ichinose-san.
text She looks me straight in the eye as she says these words.
sound DW0.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Now that you understand, I'll ask you again.
sound DW1.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Are you dating Ichinose-san right now?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Because of what she said, it's even harder to answer her.
goto 16
label 15
if intF[1089] == 1
	goto s16
fi
goto 16
label s16
text @[Tomoya]
text We're not really dating. It's more like...
text How do I explain it? I'm at a loss for words.
label 16
sound DW2.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I'll change the question if you don't know how to answer.
sound DW3.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Do you think that your being around Ichinose-san is having an influence on her?
text In some ways, that's even harder to answer.
sound DW4.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Give me a simple yes or no.
text I answer her.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound DW5.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I see. In that case, listen to me.
sound DW6.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I know I shouldn't be telling you this, but...
text She prefaces her statement and then lowers her voice.
sound DW7.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You know that there are discussions about Ichinose-san transferring abroad?
text This is the first I've heard of it.
text @[Tomoya]
text I didn't know...
sound DW8.aac
text @[Teacher]
text An institution for special scholarships has recently been founded, and they're starting exams this year.
sound DW9.aac
text @[Teacher]
text The government is paying all associated costs to allow these students to attend an American university for a year.
sound DWA.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Ichinose-san is one of the candidates. Considering her prior evaluations, it's almost a sure thing...
text There are only five openings for honor students in science courses. Because it's such a big honor, the school wants her to be in the program.
text She explains that to me, too.
sound DWB.aac
text @[Teacher]
text But Ichinose-san turned it down this past Tuesday. She said it's because she wants to study with everyone here.
sound DWC.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I said I understood and agreed with her, but...
sound DWD.aac
text @[Teacher]
text This morning, she told me she wants to move ahead with the study abroad program.
text It's like someone doused me with a bucket of cold water.
text @[Tomoya]
text What would happen if she goes abroad?
text This is the best I can muster.
sound DWE.aac
text @[Teacher]
text She'd take a leave of absence from this school and live in America for one year.
text @[Tomoya]
text What would happen after that?
sound DWF.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It'd be up to her. She could return to Japan or move on to a university over there.
sound DWG.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Except...
sound DWH.aac
text @[Teacher]
text If she's serious about her academics, she wouldn't really benefit from returning to Japan.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I can't do anything but stay quiet.
text I really don't understand why Kotomi would make this decision now.
text But there's one thing I'm certain of.
text If I let her go overseas, I'll never see Kotomi again.
sound DWI.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I've put her studying abroad issue on hold for now.
sound DWJ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text But please understand that a decision has to be made within the next week.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right.
sound DWK.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And I'm sure it goes without saying that this stays between us.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
sound DWL.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Good luck... in a lot of ways.
text I bow once more before leaving the teacher's office.
