text Guided by the signs affixed to utility poles, I wander down several streets.
text This area seems like a high-class neighborhood with mansions built on huge plots of land.
text I look at the nameplates for each household.
text However, I still can't find the address I'm looking for.
text @[Tomoya]
text Maybe it's not around here...
text Each time I turn a corner, I'm disappointed anew.
