text Before I realize it, the sun is setting.
text My shadow has grown long and darkens the street before me.
text The wind has also gotten much colder.
text The smells of dinner are emanating from the houses around me.
text I experience a feeling of warmth and nostalgia.
text There's also an irritating feeling of something strangely familiar that I can't quite put my finger on.
text It should be around here...
text Noticing how I'm desperately trying to remember something, I laugh wryly at myself.
text There's no way I'd be familiar with this area. No point in trying to find it in my memories.
text Maybe this was a reckless attempt to begin with.
text I could have just looked up the address on a map and found it right away.
text Maybe I should try again tomorrow.
music ~
