text It's a large two story house surrounded by a metal fence painted white.
text I cautiously look at the nameplate.
text "Ichinose."
text Without thinking, I run forward.
text There's a doorbell to the side of the wooden door.
text I go to press it, but hesitate for some reason.
text This doesn't feel right.
text I never went in through the front door.
text I look around.
text There's a narrow path running between the perimeter of the house and a hedge.
text In the shadow of a storage shed is a bucket, a shovel, and a rusted lawnmower.
text The path must lead to a garden.
text I walk along the path.
