text "A fishing boat witnessed the crash in Alaskan waters."
text "All 266 crew members and passengers are feared dead."
text "Among the passenger list are the Ichinoses, sending shockwaves through the world of physics."
text "The unannounced 'Superunification Theory' fades into illusion."
text Slivers of pages from books are scattered all around, like soldiers who died protecting Kotomi.
text I pick one up.
text Horizontal text is printed across the pages.
text "Regarding the Calabi-Yau manifold with the ADE-type isolated singularity, the recently reorganized posthumous manuscripts of the late Ichinoses..."
text The fragment slips from my fingers.
text "The late Ichinoses."
