text Memories intersect.
text A snow-white apron. The smell of a classy tobacco pipe.
text A beautiful grassy yard that looks as if it came right out of a dream.
text That's right.
text Kotomi is the little girl from back then.
text All she could do was sit on the floor and cry.
text Orange flames dance in front of my eyes...
