text @[Tomoya]
text Kotomi...
text My own voice has an empty echo to it.
text Hazy images are all I can recall.
text But even with just those, I know.
text I know this room... this house... and Kotomi.
text Kotomi and I met when we were kids.
text And yet... I was the only one who forgot...
text @[Tomoya]
text You knew it was me from the beginning, didn't you?
text Kotomi doesn't say anything.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why didn't you tell me...?
text Those words aren't directed at Kotomi.
text I'm disappointed with myself.
text Kotomi refuses to look at me and I stay silent.
text Then she slowly opens her mouth.
