text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, I was so happy when you came to the library.
sound DX2.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text It was like the boy from back then had come back.
sound DX3.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text It was like he had never forgotten about me...
sound DX4.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But...
sound DX5.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text As we spent time together, I realized that you actually had forgotten all about me...
sound DX6.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But even so, you became my friend...
sound DX7.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text You took care of me even though you thought you were meeting me for the first time.
text Kotomi then adds...
sound DX8.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text And I didn't know anymore.
sound DX9.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I didn't know if I wanted you to remember me, or to keep forgetting...
sound DXA.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Back then, I...
