text "One who explores the truth must not be arrogant."
sound VYG.aac
text "One must not scoff at miracles simply because they cannot be explained through science."
sound VYH.aac
text "One must not avert one's eyes from the beauty of this world."
text These were my father's words.
text Translated into many languages and printed in many books. They were very famous words.
text But I still remember.
text My father's true words.
text He had a very, very deep and kind voice.
