text @[Kotomi]
text Um...
sound DY0.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Who are you?
sound DY1.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text They told me that I can't let strangers inside.
text I was a little scared, but I gathered my courage to say that.
sound DY2.aac
text @[Young Boy]
text What is this place?
sound DY3.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text My home.
sound DY4.aac
text @[Young Boy]
text Who are you?
sound DY5.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Kotomi...
sound DY6.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Three hiragana letters, Kotomi.
sound DY7.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Call me Kotomi-chan.
sound DY8.aac
text @[Young Boy]
text What's that?
sound DY9.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text A violin.
sound DYA.aac
text @[Young Boy]
text It sounds funny.
sound DYB.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I can't play it well yet.
sound DYC.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But it sounds very, very nice when the teacher plays it.
text The boy laughed.
text So I laughed with him.
text He seemed a little different from the bullies at school.
sound DYD.aac
text @[Mother]
text Oh? Who are you talking to, Kotomi-chan?
text My mother, holding a hamper, came in and saw the boy.
sound DYE.aac
text @[Mother]
text Oh, we have an adorable visitor.
text The boy started to run away, but my mother called to him gently.
sound DYF.aac
text @[Mother]
text What's your name?
text The boy stayed quiet for a while, but then sulkily said...
sound DYG.aac
text @[Young Boy]
text Tomoya Okazaki.
sound DYH.aac
text @[Mother]
text Oh. Your name is Tomoya-kun.
text I was grabbing tightly onto my mother's apron.
text I was a little scared by my mother talking to a boy I didn't know.
sound DYI.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'm not supposed to let strangers into the house...
text My mother lightly pushed against my back to get me closer to the boy.
sound DYJ.aac
text @[Mother]
text Tomoya-kun, her name is Kotomi-chan.
sound DYK.aac
text @[Mother]
text Please be her friend.
text She bent forward and said this with a smile.
sound DYL.aac
text @[Mother]
text See? Now he's not a stranger anymore.
text The boy was staring at my mother.
text And he nodded.
text Tomoya-kun and I became friends.
