delay 60
text After they left, I cried the whole time.
text I was always a crybaby, but that was the first time in my life that I cried so much.
text I cried and cried. When I was worn out from crying, I went to sleep. When I woke up, I cried some more.
text When morning came, I was still alone.
text I brushed my teeth and washed my face. Then I went to open the refrigerator.
text It was full of my mother's cooking and the sweets she had baked.
text I felt like eating the apple pie.
text Using the largest fork I could find, I did my best to cut it in half.
text I took the slightly larger half and put it back in the refrigerator.
text I was saving it for Tomoya-kun.
text Tomoya-kun would come over around evening.
text He would be here to celebrate my birthday with me.
text The apple pie was chilled, moist, and sweet. It was very delicious.
text After I finished it, I felt a little better.
text I got on a footstool to wash the dishes, but suddenly the doorbell rang.
text I thought that maybe the maid had arrived.
text But what if... what if...
text Maybe my mother and father had come home!
text I hurried down the hallway.
text Then I unlocked the door.
text There were many adults standing there who I didn't recognize.
sound DZG.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text You must be Kotomi-chan. Hello.
sound DZH.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Who are you?
sound DZI.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Oh, we work with your mommy and daddy.
sound DZJ.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Is it okay if we come in?
sound DZK.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'm not allowed to let strangers inside.
sound DZL.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text In that case, can you ask your maid to come here?
sound DZM.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Um... um...
sound DZN.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text She's here, but she's not around right now.
text The maid wasn't there, so I lied.
text I don't know why, but I was so scared of those adults.
sound DZO.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I know this is asking a bit much, but can you let us inside?
sound DZP.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'm not allowed to let strangers inside.
sound DZQ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text My mommy and daddy are out doing something important.
sound DZR.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text You haven't heard about your mommy and daddy?
text Because I didn't respond, the adults told me.
text The airplane my mother and father were on had mechanical problems and fell into the ocean far away.
text Their very important papers had also fallen into the ocean.
text They thought there might be a copy of the papers in my father's study.
text They said that this was something very important to everyone in the world, so they wanted me to let them inside.
text The adults repeated that over and over again, but I remained silent.
text Because I still didn't understand the one thing I wanted to know the most.
sound DZS.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Where is my mommy and daddy?
sound DZT.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I said I hated Mommy and Daddy...
sound DZU.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I really love them, but I said I hated them.
sound DZV.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I have to apologize.
sound DZW.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I have to say I'm sorry.
sound DZX.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Where is my mommy and daddy?
text No one could tell me.
text Everyone looked as if they were angry, sad, or troubled.
text I became scared.
text I became very, very scared. I became so scared that I couldn't bear it any longer.
music ~
