sound 8.aac
text I slammed the door with all my strength.
sound Q.aac
text I heard pounding noises from outside the door. They were calling out, "Be a good girl and open the door!"
sound O.aac
text I locked the door.
text I ran through the house and locked all the windows.
text I was very, very scared.
text I didn't understand what had happened.
text My head was spinning while I tried my best to think.
text But no matter what, I still couldn't understand.
sound ~
text The sounds of the adults pounding on the door soon stopped.
sound 00.aac -1
text In its place, the telephone began to ring.
text I was scared, but I answered it anyway.
text It might have been my mother and father.
sound ~
text I stood on my toes to pick up the receiver.
sound DZY.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Hello...?
sound DZZ.aac
text @[Voice]
text Hello, I'm from the newspaper reporting department. I would like to confirm a few things regarding the accident.
text It was the voice of a stranger.
sound E00.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I don't know anything.
sound E01.aac
text @[Voice]
text Hello, miss. Are you Kotomi Ichinose-san? Do you have a minute to talk to me?
sound E02.aac
text @[Voice]
text It pains me to ask you this while your parents are still missing, but...
sound E03.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I don't know anything...
text I put the receiver back in its cradle.
sound 00.aac -1
text The telephone began ringing again right away.
text No matter how many times I put the receiver down, the telephone would ring again right away.
text I tried my best to cover my ears, but the telephone wouldn't stop ringing.
text I was very, very... very, very scared.
text My hands shook and my teeth chattered.
sound E04.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'm scared...
sound E05.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy... Daddy...
sound E06.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, I'm scared... Tomoya-kun...
sound E07.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun...
text I called out his name again and again.
text But Tomoya-kun never came for me.
text I took the scissors from my mother's sewing kit.
text It was a large pair of scissors my mother used to cut cloth.
text "Telephone-san, I'm so sorry," I thought to myself.
text I grabbed the phone line and snipped it with the scissors.
sound ~
text After that, the telephone stopped ringing.
