text When evening arrived, Tomoya-kun hadn't come.
text He said he would definitely come, but he hadn't.
text I continued to wait for him.
text I could tell through the curtains that it was getting dark in the yard outside.
text Tomoya-kun still hadn't come.
text Maybe he was hiding somewhere in the yard.
text Tomoya-kun was very good at hide-and-seek.
text I quietly unlocked the side door and walked barefoot out onto the grass.
