text I gathered my courage and said...
sound E08.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun...
text No answer.
sound E09.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, Tomoya-kun, Tomoya-kun...
text I called for him again and again.
sound E0A.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun...
text I listened intently.
text Still no answer.
text I looked around the yard.
text The yard looked very beautiful in the evening light.
text This is the yard where my mother, my father, and I talked.
text This is the yard where Tomoya-kun came to visit me.
text But now I was all alone...
