text I looked up at the sky.
text The sky was a scary, dusky color.
text It looked as if it were burning.
text I felt like I was going to cry, but I didn't.
text It's because I remembered my father's words.
text It was a very, very wonderful idea.
sound E0B.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text God...
text I spoke quietly.
sound E0C.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text God, please come.
sound E0D.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Mommy and Daddy's airplane fell into the ocean.
sound E0E.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text The airplane sank to the bottom of the ocean.
sound E0F.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I think it's because I was a bad girl.
sound E0G.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I think it's because I said "I hate you" to Mommy and Daddy.
sound E0H.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I think it's because I actually love them, but I lied.
sound E0I.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text God...
sound E0J.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text The ocean is very cold and you can't breathe in it.
sound E0K.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text It's very, very painful, and cold, and lonely.
sound E0L.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I would cry if it was me.
sound E0M.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But maybe Mommy and Daddy wouldn't cry...
sound E0N.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But it must be very, very painful, and cold, and lonely.
sound E0O.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text God...
sound E0P.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Daddy told me.
sound E0Q.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text God is invisible to the eye, but is always watching over us.
sound E0R.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I think God is watching me even now.
sound E0S.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I think God is listening to me right now.
sound E0T.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text So please, God.
sound E0U.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Please let Mommy and Daddy come home.
sound E0V.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be a really good girl.
sound E0W.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll never cause any trouble for anyone.
sound E0X.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll eat anything they tell me to eat.
sound E0Y.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll go to school every day.
sound E0Z.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll study a lot.
sound E10.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll read lots of books and grow up to be a great person.
sound E11.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text So please return Mommy and Daddy to me.
sound E12.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Please let Mommy and Daddy come home.
sound E13.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Please give them back...
sound E14.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Please give Mommy and Daddy back.
sound E15.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Please give them back...
sound E16.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Give them back to me...
text I listened intently.
text I tried to hear the sounds of the harps.
text I tried to hear the kindly voice of God.
text But I heard nothing.
text There was no one there.
text There was no kind God.
text My mother and father weren't there.
text I was all alone.
text All alone.
